{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "e982f4f7f517481288228d1418f8cb75", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "新客户开售后备件清单怎么列", "id": "62232504ed3f4d18913d78fa6cd810a6", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:24.171345", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "c13bda6a0a7044d883df82203b8a8e77", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:24.171345"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "这是一个业务咨询问题，结合上下文直接给出结构化回答。", "id": "88753ec7c5874e799019e46f45ec1ef3", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:32.889805", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "按机型列：制袋类（硅胶压板、加热管、切刀组件）、计量类（计量螺杆）、灌装类（机械密封）、装盒类（真空吸盘、气缸密封圈）、通用（光电开关、同步带）。建议随机附 3 个月用量，易损件备 2 套。", "id": "fdebac43d7e144a5a1526ab1e90bf401", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:32.889805", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:32.889805"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "7ec15766ea60443bb952c679fb82e802", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:32.889805", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T10:23:32.889805"}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "把常见售后问题整理成一页培训材料", "id": "8019a14a008c41238021549ba53ce65e", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:19.944478", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "99dfe3b74af04914b3f7329cb8f1201a", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:19.944478"}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "分析用户诉求后，按要点组织答案，保持简洁准确。", "id": "ab064ac4af654bb696f54a9f353d584d", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:44.444967", "finished_at": null}, {"type": "text", "text": "已整理《售后常见问题速查》：\n1. 封口不严/漏气：优先查加热温度与硅胶压板磨损，备件硅胶压板160。\n2. 膜材跑偏：校膜卷对中与色标传感器。\n3. 切刀切不断：更换横封切刀组件并调间隙至0.02mm。\n4. 计量波动：计量螺杆磨损或物料架桥，加装振动器。\n5. 装盒卡盒：真空吸盘老化，换吸盘并校气压0.55MPa。\n建议附现场照片规范与报修流程图。", "id": "0bc982bf0ba542a29ae6fae5d5e3a9bf", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:44.444967", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:44.444967"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "0f21d7fef74640589ba887203614573b", "created_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:44.444967", "finished_at": "2026-09-17T10:26:44.444967"}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}, "scroll": {"persisted_ids": [], "persisted_tcids": []}, "mode_state": {}}}